WEBVTT

00:03:29.723 --> 00:03:36.422
(Laughter)

00:03:36.422 --> 00:03:41.056
(Applause)

00:03:41.056 --> 00:03:44.022
So maybe you have to think about a second theory

00:03:44.022 --> 00:03:46.939
if the first one isn't good enough.

00:03:46.939 --> 00:03:48.723
Second theory is: Could we upgrade?

00:03:48.723 --> 00:03:51.622
(Laughter)

00:03:51.622 --> 00:03:54.856
Well, why would one ask a question like that?

00:03:54.856 --> 00:03:57.321
Because there have been at least 29 upgrades so far

00:03:57.321 --> 00:03:59.357
of humanoids.

00:03:59.357 --> 00:04:02.207
So it turns out that we have upgraded.